        },
        {
          "text": " Tetere iyoŋit EJAKAIT Ekonideke, iricenenei ikekisila kere ka akeicorakineta, nukecorakini jo, ka ikonikoku ka epapaitikon, apaarasia kere nuka aijarakon; tetere ibusi apaarasia nuipu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso kiira, ijo Isirael, koricite aiswamaenen kwaŋin; ijaun ejok, ido kipuaros noi, kwape kolo kisumunio EJAKAIT, Edeke loka lukapapaakon, kakwap naeleleete akile ka esik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
